# T requires sixteen names, U those and b, V those and c too. A type of sixteen names and more that requires one name more than another type is met by those that meet the other and hold the name:
# U through T, V through U or through the odd literal, which holds c and lacks b and meets T alone. The families are what a walk through all the names of each pair finds.
